{"id":1420,"date":"2026-08-22T22:34:49","date_gmt":"2026-08-22T22:34:49","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/?post_type=knowledgebase&#038;p=1420"},"modified":"2026-08-23T04:53:36","modified_gmt":"2026-08-23T04:53:36","slug":"context-menus","status":"publish","type":"knowledgebase","link":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/db\/layout-tools\/context-menus\/","title":{"rendered":"Context Menus"},"content":{"rendered":"<div style=\"color: #2b2b2b;\">\n<h2 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Context Menus<\/span><\/h2>\n<p class=\"western\">Open Publisher replaces the browser&#8217;s default right-click menu with custom, application-specific context menus throughout the entire workspace. Every area of the interface has its own tailored menu with relevant options for that location.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Canvas Right-Click Menu<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-1423\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/6A22.tmp_.jpg\" alt=\"Canvas Right-Click Menu\" width=\"264\" height=\"377\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/6A22.tmp_.jpg 642w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/6A22.tmp_-210x300.jpg 210w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 264px) 100vw, 264px\" \/><\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">Right-clicking on an empty area of the document canvas (not on an element) opens a menu with:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Insert sub-menu &#8211;<\/strong> Table, Styled Tables, Text Box, Picture, Shape, Drawing, QR Code, and more.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Format Background &#8211;<\/strong> Opens the background colour and texture dialog.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Snap to toggles &#8211;<\/strong> Grid, Guides, and Objects.<\/span><br \/>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-1425\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/76D4.tmp_.jpg\" alt=\"Element Right-Click Menus\" width=\"155\" height=\"377\" \/><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Show\/Hide Rulers, Toggle Grid, Page Design\/Size.<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Element Right-Click Menus<\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">Right-clicking a canvas element opens a contextual menu specific to that element type:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Text Box &#8211;<\/strong> Layering controls (Bring Forward, Send Backward, etc.), formatting options, Save as Picture, and copy\/paste actions.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Table &#8211;<\/strong> Insert Row\/Column, Delete Row\/Column\/Table, Merge Cell options, and Clear Cell Text.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Image &#8211;<\/strong> Layering controls, crop options, and Save as Picture.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Page Thumbnail Right-Click Menu<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-1431\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/84BD.tmp_.jpg\" alt=\"Page Thumbnail Right-Click Menu\" width=\"173\" height=\"279\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/84BD.tmp_.jpg 455w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/84BD.tmp_-186x300.jpg 186w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 173px) 100vw, 173px\" \/><\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">Right-clicking a page thumbnail in the left sidebar opens a page management menu with:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Duplicate Page<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Move Page Up \/ Down<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Delete Page<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Add Note (add a custom label to the thumbnail)<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Master Pages sub-menu (Set Master, Ignore Master, None)<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Workspace Background Right-Click Menu<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-1434\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/5CCC.tmp_.jpg\" alt=\"Workspace Background Right-Click Menu\" width=\"188\" height=\"341\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/5CCC.tmp_.jpg 399w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/5CCC.tmp_-166x300.jpg 166w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 188px) 100vw, 188px\" \/><\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">Right-clicking the grey workspace area <em>outside<\/em> the document canvas opens a menu with:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Add new blank page<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Show\/Hide Rulers<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Toggle page margins<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Page Design\/Size<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Format Background<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Ribbon Right-Click Menu<br \/>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-1438\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/AA3C.tmp_.jpg\" alt=\"Ribbon Right-Click Menu\" width=\"197\" height=\"222\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/AA3C.tmp_.jpg 449w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/AA3C.tmp_-266x300.jpg 266w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 197px) 100vw, 197px\" \/><\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">Right-clicking the empty grey space in the ribbon toolbar opens a menu with:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Toggle Fullscreen<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Export to PDF<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Save Project<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Toggle Grid Background<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Reload App<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Title Bar Right-Click Menu<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-1441\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/A43D.tmp_.jpg\" alt=\"Title Bar Right-Click Menu\" width=\"182\" height=\"340\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/A43D.tmp_.jpg 498w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/A43D.tmp_-160x300.jpg 160w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 182px) 100vw, 182px\" \/><\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">Right-clicking the empty space in the top menu bar (where the document title is displayed) opens a menu with:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Rename Publication<\/span><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-1445\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/B060.tmp_.jpg\" alt=\"Zoom Bar Right-Click Menu\" width=\"199\" height=\"492\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/B060.tmp_.jpg 293w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/B060.tmp_-121x300.jpg 121w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 199px) 100vw, 199px\" \/><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Copy \/ Paste<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Page Setup<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Save \/ Export \/ Print<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Reload App and About<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Zoom Bar Right-Click Menu<\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">Right-clicking the zoom slider in the bottom-right corner opens a quick scale menu with preset zoom levels from 60% to 200%, for instant one-click access to the most common zoom settings.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Context Menus Open Publisher replaces the browser&#8217;s default right-click menu with custom, application-specific context menus throughout the entire workspace. Every area of the interface has its own tailored menu with relevant options for that location. Canvas Right-Click Menu Right-clicking on an empty area of the document canvas (not on an element) opens a menu with: [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":1450,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","template":"","knowledgebase_cat":[20],"class_list":["post-1420","knowledgebase","type-knowledgebase","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","knowledgebase_cat-layout-tools"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/1420","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase"}],"about":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/knowledgebase"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=1420"}],"version-history":[{"count":19,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/1420\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":1448,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/1420\/revisions\/1448"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/1450"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=1420"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"knowledgebase_cat","embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase_cat?post=1420"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}